#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:9
msgid "Wait correctly and shut down an explicit owner"
msgstr "正确等待并停止显式 owner"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:11
msgid ""
"Use this guide for applications selecting an optional Native, FreeRTOS or "
"ThreadX adapter. The application owns tasks, stacks, notifications, queues "
"and execution progress. Baremetal has no scheduler. Platform start never "
"starts a kernel. The [OS contract](../reference/contracts/os/execution.md) "
"remains authoritative."
msgstr ""
"选择可选 Native、FreeRTOS 或 ThreadX adapter "
"的应用使用本指南。应用拥有任务、栈、通知、队列和执行进度。裸机没有调度器。平台启动从不启动内核。[OS "
"合同](../reference/contracts/os/execution.md)保持权威。"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:16
msgid ""
"Use the common opaque task, notification, queue and channel APIs. Include "
"`nexus/os/storage.h` only in files defining zero-initialized static objects "
"and native-word stacks; ordinary business headers do not include kernel "
"headers. One executable selects one backend. The current implementation does"
" not by itself establish final software-candidate or physical qualification."
msgstr ""
"使用公共 opaque 任务、通知、queue 和 channel API。只在定义清零静态对象及原生元素栈的文件中包含 "
"`nexus/os/storage.h`，普通业务头不包含内核头。每个可执行文件选择一个后端。当前实现本身不授予最终软件候选或物理资格。"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:22
msgid "Avoid lost completion and unbounded waits"
msgstr "避免丢失完成和无限等待"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:24
msgid ""
"Use the request's latched predicate as truth. Check the completion "
"predicate, arm the notification sequence, recheck, wait with the same "
"absolute monotonic deadline, then recheck again. Wakes are hints and may be "
"coalesced or unrelated. On timeout, perform the contract's final predicate "
"observation. Do not restart a relative budget after each hint and do not "
"block the only executor that must make progress."
msgstr ""
"以请求的锁存谓词为权威。先检查完成谓词，调用 `arm` "
"快照通知序列，再次检查，以同一绝对单调截止时间等待，然后再次检查。唤醒只是提示，可能合并或与当前请求无关。超时后执行合同要求的最后一次谓词观察。不得在每次提示后重新开始相对时间预算，也不得阻塞唯一负责推进的执行者。"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:30
msgid ""
"![Predicate, wake and explicit shutdown "
"responsibilities](../assets/diagrams/wait-wake-shutdown.svg)"
msgstr "![谓词、唤醒与显式停机责任](../assets/diagrams/wait-wake-shutdown.svg)"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:30
msgid "Predicate, wake and explicit shutdown responsibilities"
msgstr "谓词、唤醒与显式停机责任"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:32
msgid ""
"FIG-08 shows the current wait/wake responsibilities. A provider IRQ sink "
"must respect the selected kernel syscall ceiling; an unqualified priority "
"cannot call an ISR kernel API. ThreadX has its own reviewed M4/Native subset"
" and masking policy, not the FreeRTOS port or tickless/isolation capability "
"set."
msgstr ""
"FIG-08 表示当前 wait/唤醒责任。提供者 IRQ 接收端必须遵守选定内核系统调用优先级阈值；不合法优先级不得调用 ISR 内核 "
"API。ThreadX 有自己复核的 M4/Native 子集和屏蔽策略，不继承 FreeRTOS 端口或 tickless/isolation "
"能力集。"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:37
msgid "Shut down in dependency order"
msgstr "按依赖顺序停机"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:39
msgid "Close client admission and reject new work without borrowing it."
msgstr "关闭客户端准入，不借用地拒绝新工作。"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:40
msgid ""
"Keep the resource owner/executor running. Request cancellation using stable "
"slots and matching epochs; cancellation does not release accepted storage."
msgstr "保持资源 owner/执行者运行。通过稳定槽与匹配 epoch 请求取消；取消不释放已接受的存储。"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:42
msgid ""
"Drain transfers and block loans. Acquire-observe SETTLED and read results. A"
" failed drain retains QUARANTINED storage and explicit recovery "
"responsibility."
msgstr "排空传输和块借用。Acquire 观察 SETTLED 并读取结果。失败排空保留 QUARANTINED 存储和明确恢复责任。"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:44
msgid ""
"Join producers and detach/join control observers before slot or request "
"reuse."
msgstr "复用槽或请求前，join 生产者并 detach/join 控制观察者。"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:45
msgid ""
"Stop and join the owner. Quiesce hardware IRQ publishers before destroying "
"their notification, queue, guard, stack or TCB storage."
msgstr "停止并 join owner。销毁通知、队列、临界区保护、栈或 TCB 存储前，确保硬件 IRQ 发布者停止访问并完成必要同步。"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:47
msgid ""
"Stop platform providers only when their selected lifetime and kernel "
"clock/Tick ownership permit it. A running scheduler is not stopped by "
"ordinary I/O teardown."
msgstr "只有选定生命周期与内核时钟/Tick 所有权允许时才能停止 platform 提供者。普通 I/O 拆除不停止正在运行的调度器。"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:50
msgid "Task return has a backend-specific implementation:"
msgstr "任务返回后的实现因后端而异："

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:0
msgid "Backend"
msgstr "后端"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:0
msgid "After the application entry returns"
msgstr "应用入口返回后的行为"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:0
msgid "External owner must prove"
msgstr "外部所有者必须证明"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:0
msgid "Native"
msgstr "Native"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:0
msgid "The pthread entry returns and the host thread terminates"
msgstr "pthread 入口返回，主机线程终止"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:0
msgid "Successful `nx_task_join_until()` after actual pthread exit"
msgstr "实际 pthread 退出后 `nx_task_join_until()` 成功"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:0
msgid "FreeRTOS"
msgstr "FreeRTOS"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:0
msgid ""
"The wrapper publishes its completion hint and suspends until the external "
"joiner deletes it"
msgstr "包装任务发布完成提示，然后挂起，直到外部 join 调用方将其删除"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:0
msgid "Successful `nx_task_join_until()` after external kernel deletion"
msgstr "外部内核删除后 `nx_task_join_until()` 成功"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:0
msgid "ThreadX"
msgstr "ThreadX"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:0
msgid ""
"The wrapper publishes its return predicate and completion hint, then follows"
" the kernel completion path"
msgstr "包装任务发布返回谓词和完成提示，然后进入内核完成路径"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:0
msgid "Successful `nx_task_join_until()` after real ThreadX deletion"
msgstr "真实 ThreadX 删除后 `nx_task_join_until()` 成功"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:58
msgid ""
"Returning from an entry function or observing a completion hint never "
"authorizes stack/TCB reclamation. Keep wrapper, stack and kernel-control "
"storage until the one external lifecycle owner successfully joins it. Raw "
"queues and closable queues have different lifecycle contracts; close is not "
"destruction. Keep all storage on the failure path and retry cleanup only "
"through its real owner. Native finite join uses the real GNU monotonic "
"clock-join path; a completion flag followed by unbounded `pthread_join` is "
"not equivalent. The Native process clock remains independent of "
"deterministic peripheral-model clocks."
msgstr ""
"入口函数返回或观察到完成提示都不授权回收栈／TCB。在唯一外部生命周期责任者成功 join 前，保留 wrapper、栈和内核控制存储。raw "
"queue 与可关闭队列有不同的生命周期合同，close 不是销毁。失败路径保留所有存储，只能通过真实 owner 重试清理。Native 有限 "
"join 使用真实 GNU 单调 clock-join 路径；完成标志后再无界调用 `pthread_join` 并不等价。Native "
"进程时钟独立于可确定性推进的外设模型时钟。"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:67
msgid ""
"Channels require an initialized exclusive caller waiter for each "
"simultaneous send/receive. Close rejects sends with `CANCELLED`, wakes "
"blockers and retains queued items; receive reports `CANCELLED` only when "
"closed and drained. Queue deadline zero is an immediate try. A raw queue has"
" no close broadcast and needs an external protocol ensuring callers exit "
"before destruction."
msgstr ""
"channel 的每个并发发送／接收使用一个已初始化的独占调用者 waiter。close 使发送返回 "
"`CANCELLED`，唤醒阻塞者并保留队列中的数据；仅在关闭且排空后接收才返回 `CANCELLED`。queue 的 deadline 零表示立即 "
"try。raw queue 没有关闭广播，需要外部协议保证调用者退出后再销毁。"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:73
msgid ""
"`nx_os_run` succeeds without returning. Native parks its existing bootstrap "
"thread to preserve caller-stack loans; process exit is explicit application "
"policy. Native supports only logical priority zero. The common priority "
"order is larger values first; do not pass ThreadX native priority numbers "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"`nx_os_run` 成功不返回。Native 停驻既有 bootstrap 线程以保留调用者栈的借用，进程退出由应用显式决定。Native "
"只支持逻辑优先级 0。公共优先级方向为高数值优先，不能直接传 ThreadX 原生优先级编号。"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:78
msgid "Retain ownership after task-start failures"
msgstr "任务启动失败后保留所有权"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:80
msgid ""
"A non-successful start does not always mean clean rejection. INVALID/CONTEXT"
" reject the current attempt without new effects; they do not release "
"references held by an already live task. ThreadX may create a task "
"successfully and then report IO when resume fails, retaining the live "
"control and its borrowed storage."
msgstr ""
"start 非成功并不总是干净拒绝。INVALID／CONTEXT 拒绝本次尝试而不新增效果，但不释放既有 live 任务持有的引用。ThreadX "
"可能先成功创建任务，再因 resume 失败返回 IO，同时保留 live 控制对象及其借用存储。"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:85
msgid ""
"For a creation or cleanup failure without proof of complete withdrawal, "
"retain the control, stack, name and context. Use discard only when the "
"selected phase and actual entry state prove that the task never executed; "
"otherwise use the permitted cooperative-completion/join path or explicit "
"external recovery. If teardown cannot be proved, do not reinitialize or free"
" the object. There is no generic task destroy or kill that safely revokes "
"these responsibilities."
msgstr ""
"创建或清理失败且无法证明已经完整撤回时，保留控制对象、栈、名称和 context。只有所选阶段和真实入口状态证明任务从未执行时才能 "
"discard；否则使用允许的合作式完成／join 路径或显式外部恢复。无法证明结束时，不得重新初始化或释放对象。没有能够安全撤销这些责任的通用任务 "
"destroy 或 kill。"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:92
msgid "Execute maintained software fixtures"
msgstr "执行维护中的软件夹具"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:94
msgid ""
"First prepare the [fixed source and recursive dependencies](source-"
"checkout.md). From that repository root, with host build tools available:"
msgstr "先准备[固定源码与递归依赖](source-checkout.md)。然后从该仓库根目录、在主机构建工具可用的条件下执行："

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:107
msgid ""
"All binaries must execute nonempty passing cases. This targeted development "
"scope does not replace the complete TDD gate. The external UART owner "
"application in [nexus-examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples)"
" supplies product workers; its pin/revision must be recorded before claiming"
" consumer execution."
msgstr ""
"所有二进制都必须执行非空且通过的用例。此定向开发范围不能替代完整 TDD 门禁。[nexus-"
"examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples) 中的外部 UART owner "
"应用提供产品 worker；声明已执行消费者前必须记录其 pin／revision。"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-shutdown.md:112
msgid ""
"Physical scheduler context, IRQ ceiling, FP/MVE retention, stack peaks and "
"wake latency require real station evidence. Do not inherit POSIX behavior as"
" MCU timing."
msgstr "物理调度器上下文、IRQ 优先级阈值、FP/MVE 保留、栈峰值和唤醒延迟需要真实工位证据。不得将 POSIX 行为继承为 MCU 时序。"
